999x &= 9 \\
x &= \frac{9}{999} \\
\end{aligned}
Simplifying the fraction $\frac{9}{999}$, we get:
\begin{aligned}
\frac{9}{999} &= \frac{9 \div 9}{999 \div 9} \\
&= \frac{1}{111}
\end{aligned}
The product of the numerator and the denominator is:
\begin{aligned}
\text{Product} &= 1 \times 111 \\
&= 111
\end{aligned}
